(7225190, 1114781, 156466, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kiwinick:</b></div><hr/><i> good to see some proper macro photos this is a very nice shot though I would like more sharpness 6 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Are you suggesting that <i>more</i> of husk should have been in focus, or that the focus isn''t tack sharp, which I''m pretty sure it is.  And you can only "sharpen" so much in a minimal edit.</td>', 'Originally posted by kiwinick: good to see some proper macro photos this is a very nice shot though I would like more sharpness 6   Are you suggesting that more of husk should have been in focus, or that the focus isn''t tack sharp, which I''m pretty sure it is.  And you can only "sharpen" so much in a minimal edit.', '2014-06-06 05:25:26.000000', NULL, 0),
