(7225308, 1114282, 19959, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by KarenNfld:</b></div><hr/><i> Very cute. Doesn''t look like a real goldfish, though, looks like it''s printed on a piece of paper behind the fishbowl. Still clever! </i></td></tr></table> Very Perceptive... it didn''t really work as a single shot, minimal edit challenge... would have liked to focus stack and make some edits...</td>', 'Originally posted by KarenNfld: Very cute. Doesn''t look like a real goldfish, though, looks like it''s printed on a piece of paper behind the fishbowl. Still clever!  Very Perceptive... it didn''t really work as a single shot, minimal edit challenge... would have liked to focus stack and make some edits...', '2014-06-06 17:35:14.000000', NULL, 0),
